      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766127383223,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Check for Login Credentials\n-Match creds, and allow to login a user\n-If email nout found then thrw error \"Account not exist\"\n Password does not match thrw an error msg,  \"Invalid Password\"\n- When clicked on SignUp, Land to SignUp page and only portal user will be create.\n-When Clicked on Forget Password click on Forget Password page",
      "fontSize": 12.652141356364945,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Check for Login Credentials\n-Match creds, and allow to login a user\n-If email nout found then thrw error \"Account not exist\"\n Password does not match thrw an error msg,  \"Invalid Password\"\n- When clicked on SignUp, Land to SignUp page and only portal user will be create.\n-When Clicked on Forget Password click on Forget Password page",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5oncY9u9Z-ifeCfviy7jW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -201.85362659146426,
      "y": -3659.9191504716873,
      "width": 430.46636962890625,
      "height": 87.047620500837,
